Z||000017||Slammed Fiero||09-18-2001||06:40 PM||||Jay , Scrap the turbo , there's a nice little area where the caddy used to have a powersteering pump that would be perfect for a Supercharger.<P>Get a unit for a 4.6ltr mustang , (same displacement) What you need is a computer guru to tune the car to rear for pressure in the manifold instead of vacume<P>you figure the 4.6ltr Vortec unit offers a 35% increase in HP bone stock.<P>You may also want to look into Caroll shelby. The series 2 car now comes equiped with a 4.0ltr small N* with a blower.<P><BR>Giddy up.<P>JM ||||reg||1
